# The redundant colour variants are not tracked, and this is the reason.
#
# Eleven of the sixteen exports embed the **byte-identical** raster (md5 a40b77353418) — the same
# 2676x1492 monogram PNG — differing only in a background `<rect>` of black, white or #D9D9D9.
# Committing all of them would store that one megabyte eleven times, for 13 MB in the repository's
# history forever, to hold artwork that is already here once.
#
# What IS tracked:
#
#   tr-icon.svg     the master. Transparent, the raster every other variant embeds, and the file
#                   `scripts/build-brand-assets.mjs` reads.
#   *-text.svg      the four wordmark exports. Real vector paths, 5.7 kB each, no raster at all.
#
# Everything below is reproducible from `tr-icon.svg` by compositing a background, which is exactly
# what the ignored files are. They are still on disk — nothing was deleted — so the full hand-over
# is intact locally and can be re-exported at any time.
#
# **To commit one anyway:** `git add -f brand/<file>.svg`. If the whole set should be in history
# after all, delete this file.

*.svg
!tr-icon.svg
!*-text.svg
